  "disposition": "COMPLETE_TYPED_FUNCTION_OR_EQUALITY_SEAMS_MATERIALIZED_UNCOMPILED",
  "review_notes": [
    "Each1458B original and3057B organized source read separately in full. InSameOrbit is precisely existential action reachability: there is g:A.Spin with A.act g M=N. No separate group operation law on Spin or equivalence relation proof is present.",
    "The whole OrbitCanonicalizer keeps canonical,spinFromCanonical and both actual universal proof fields. reconstruct sends canonical M back to M using its chosen spin; canonical_in_orbit has the original opposite direction, from M to canonical M. Neither field is dropped or replaced by an assumed named Prop.",
    "One complete seam retains InSameOrbit, the whole OrbitCanonicalizer and orbitCanonicalizer_reconstruct with exact implicit A,full C and M. A second seam retains the exact identity copyCanonicalizer and its reconstruction theorem, importing only the new same-source interface component. Its rfl/existential proofs and Unit spin are unchanged.",
    "No canonical constancy on orbits, uniqueness, idempotence, finite search, action faithfulness or concrete geometric matrix symmetry is inferred. Both new components retain the exact original MatrixSymmetry import and use that historical MatrixAction/copyAction, not the new review348 type."
  ],
